<title>JAPAN: Japan four-year JGB auction lowest price 99.76.</title>
<headline>Japan four-year JGB auction lowest price 99.76.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said the results of its 1.2 percent four-year Japanese government bond</p>
<p>(JGB) auction on Tuesday were as follows:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 99.76   Stop rate     1.262 pct</p>
<p> Average price	99.81   Average yield 1.249 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   1.416 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	498.5 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 96.8325 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   Dec 20, 1996   Maturity   Dec 20, 2000</p>
<p> Coupon payment   June 20, Dec 20</p>
</text>
